---
import Guide from './Guide.astro';
import Spec from './Spec.astro';

const scale = [
  { name: 'display', cls: 'text-display font-display', sample: 'Put a system behind it', spec: 'display / clamp(2.375rem, 3.625rem) / 1.06 / 700 / -0.025em' },
  { name: 'h2', cls: 'text-h2 font-display', sample: 'Selected work', spec: 'display / clamp(1.875rem, 2.75rem) / 1.1 / 650 / -0.02em' },
  { name: 'h3', cls: 'text-h3 font-display', sample: 'One brand system, forty practices', spec: 'display / clamp(1.1875rem, 1.375rem) / 1.25 / 650 / -0.01em' },
  { name: 'body', cls: 'text-body', sample: 'Brand, web, motion, and automation shipped by one person.', spec: 'sans / clamp(1rem, 1.125rem) / 1.6 / 400 / 0, max 65ch' },
  { name: 'small', cls: 'text-small text-muted', sample: 'Secondary copy, captions, and metadata sit one step down.', spec: 'sans / 0.875rem / 1.5 / 400' },
  { name: 'meta', cls: 'meta text-muted', sample: 'Worked with', spec: 'sans / 0.8125rem / 1.4 / 600 / +0.005em, sentence case' },
  { name: 'stat', cls: 'text-stat font-display tabular-nums', sample: '+25%', spec: 'display / clamp(1.75rem, 2.5rem) / 1.1 / 700 / -0.02em / tnum' },
];
---

<Guide
  id="type"
  title="Typography"
  intro="Funnel Display carries headlines and stats, Funnel Sans carries everything you read, and Spline Sans Mono appears only for literal file names, paths, and code."
>
  <div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <Spec label="Funnel Display" note="Headlines, stats, the wordmark. Variable, self-hosted, weights 650 to 700.">
      <p class="font-display text-[3rem] leading-none font-bold tracking-[-0.025em]">Aa</p>
      <p class="mt-4 font-display text-body font-[650] break-words">ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz 0123456789</p>
      <p class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 font-display text-body">
        <span class="font-[650]">Heading 650</span>
        <span class="font-bold">Display 700</span>
      </p>
    </Spec>
    <Spec label="Funnel Sans" note="Body, captions, buttons, labels. Variable, self-hosted, weights 400 to 600.">
      <p class="text-[3rem] leading-none font-semibold">Aa</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-body break-words">ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz 0123456789</p>
      <p class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-body">
        <span class="font-normal">Regular 400</span>
        <span class="font-medium">Medium 500</span>
        <span class="font-semibold">Semibold 600</span>
      </p>
    </Spec>
    <Spec label="Spline Sans Mono" note="Literal file names, paths, and code only. Never labels, never uppercase, never tracked.">
      <p class="font-mono text-[3rem] leading-none font-medium">Aa</p>
      <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-[0.8125rem] break-words">Seasonal_Spring-2026_Image_V1_Story_Client</p>
      <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-[0.8125rem] text-muted break-words">
        {'{ "archetype": "The Wellness Educator" }'}
      </p>
    </Spec>
  </div>

  <div class="rounded-card border border-line">
    {scale.map((row) => (
      <div class="type-row">
        <code class="font-mono text-[0.75rem] text-dash-ink">{row.name}</code>
        <p class:list={['min-w-0', row.cls]}>{row.sample}</p>
        <code class="font-mono text-[0.6875rem] text-muted">{row.spec}</code>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <ul class="rules">
    <li>The <code class="font-mono text-[0.8125rem]">.meta</code> class is the one small-label voice: sentence-case sans, 600. No uppercase, no tracked lettering, anywhere.</li>
    <li>Mono is reserved for literal data: file names, paths, token names and values, code excerpts. If it reads as a sentence or names a thing for a reader, it is sans.</li>
    <li>Letter-spacing never goes tighter than -0.025em; only display, h2, and stat track negative.</li>
    <li>Stats always set <code class="font-mono text-[0.8125rem]">font-feature-settings: "tnum"</code> so digits align in columns.</li>
    <li>Body measure caps at 65ch. Headlines are sentence case, eight words or fewer.</li>
  </ul>
</Guide>

<style>
  .type-row {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 1rem 1rem;
  }
  .type-row + .type-row { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line); }
  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .type-row { grid-template-columns: 72px minmax(0, 1fr) 300px; }
  }
  .rules {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    list-style: disc;
    max-width: 70ch;
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
</style>
